  "created_at": "2026-05-19T15:48:07Z",
  "description": "Expected: QE historical training/backtest templates use a point-in-time stock pool aligned with the fixed backtest window. For the default QE historical window test_end=2026-04-28 and backtest_end=2026-04-27, templates, MCP preflight, and backend validation should use or require filtered_pool_20260428 and reject filtered_pool dates later than test_end, such as filtered_pool_20260519. Paper/simulation/live flows may use their own cutoff/universe rules and should not affect historical backtests.\nActual: A custom_evo template created through QE MCP referenced filtered_pool_20260519 in loop.stock_pool and strategy_params.stock_pool. Backend validation could still return valid=true and materialize failed later with a missing stock pool RuntimeError/500. If the future/latest pool file exists, fixed historical backtests can be contaminated by a future universe.",
